      "height": 96,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "Phase 2 — Lab execution (Terminal B) — scenario-specific\n1. Learner → Victim: cd victim-app && npm install\n2. Victim → MalPkg: npm lifecycle runs shai-hulud postinstall.js\n3. MalPkg → Mock: POST harvested npm and GitHub tokens to :3001/collect\n4. MalPkg → MalPkg: Read package-lock.json for @victim-org/*",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 2 — Lab execution (Terminal B) — scenario-specific\n1. Learner → Victim: cd victim-app && npm install\n2. Victim → MalPkg: npm lifecycle runs shai-hulud postinstall.js\n3. MalPkg → Mock: POST harvested npm and GitHub tokens to :3001/collect\n4. MalPkg → MalPkg: Read package-lock.json for @victim-org/*",
